window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Torn between two realms, Eleanor must save her mate before they destroy everything they’re fighting for.</b></p> <p>Eleanor needs Ruskin—the darkly magnetic fae prince she’s bound to—more than ever. But Ruskin is gone, trapped in the deadly space between realms. When Eleanor finally rescues him, the man she loves is a stranger, his memories erased and his trust shattered.</p> <p>There’s no time to rebuild what they’ve lost. In the human realm, Eleanor’s father is held captive by a ruthless king, while in Faerie, Ruskin’s mother, Evanthe, threatens to plunge the Seelie Court into chaos. With war brewing on all sides, Eleanor must rely on dangerous allies and powers she doesn’t fully understand to stop Evanthe’s destruction.</p> <p>But as Eleanor’s fae magic grows stronger, so does the risk of losing herself to its darkness. And a terrifying prophecy whispers that she and Ruskin might not save the realm at all…but destroy it together.</p> <p>With time running out and the bond between them fraying, Eleanor must decide how far she’ll go to save Ruskin—and what she’s willing to sacrifice to protect both their worlds.</p>"; 
